        // 2. GEMINI PARSER REWRITTEN: Properly splits "BTCUSD"→BTC/USD,
        //    "ETHBTC"→ETH/BTC, "SAMOGUSD"→SAMO/GUSD using known quote suffixes.
        // 3. CCXT WORKER READY: Deploy the companion Cloudflare Worker (see bottom
